  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/IMG_0542.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Amb el dinar per a pensionistes i homenatge a l&#39;home i la dona de major edat,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/P1710545.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>i amb la desfilada de disfresses infantls, que va acabar amb un berenar al sal&oacute; de la Mancomunitat Espad&agrave; Millars i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/P1710706.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>classes de masterchef, a c&agrave;rrec de Diver Twin.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestestalesnovembre17/img_0510.jpg\" alt=\"img_0510\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestestalesnovembre17/img_0511.jpg\" alt=\"img_0511\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestestalesnovembre17/img_0512.jpg\" alt=\"img_0512\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestestalesnovembre17/img_0513.jpg\" alt=\"img_0513\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestestalesnovembre17/img_0516.jpg\" alt=\"img_0516\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestestalesnovembre17/img_0517.jpg\" alt=\"img_0517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfestestalesnovembre17/img_0519.jpg\" alt=\"img_0519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-91